        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Offshore operations deliver high-quality customer experience because the fundamentals that drive performance—talent, training, technology, and structured oversight—have nothing to do with geography. The reason is simple: customer support outsourcing decisions carry real business consequences. Customer loyalty, retention revenue, and brand reputation all run through the service layer. Getting the model wrong is costly. Getting it [&hellip;]]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
